# Generated captures, screenshots, traces, and machine-specific logs.
#
# Run records (*.jsonl) are deliberately NOT in this list. They are the evidence a
# gate was passed on - FINISH-CRITERIA.md cites gate4-1000-tap/results.jsonl by name -
# and ignoring them meant three passed gates rested on files that existed only on one
# machine. All 21 of them together are under 9 MB. Screen captures stay out: they run
# to 755 MB and are supporting illustration, not the record.
